The film was released on 3 December 2010.

12
01:15:00,000 --> 01:15:06,000
Its plot concerns a 19th-century warrior named Yang (Jang Dong-gun), who is
ordered to kill the last member of an enemy clan — a baby girl.

13
01:21:15,000 --> 01:21:21,000
He refuses the mission and flees with the child to a
dilapidated town in the American West.

14
